/mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>).</p>","file":"ch03-groups-and-permutations/04-permutations-and-cycles.html"}